# Sphinx build cache. `sphinx-build -b html <src> <out>` writes its internal
# doctree cache to <out>/.doctrees; it is never served, and it embeds the
# intersphinx inventory of CPython's own stdlib docs. Keep it out of the
# committed HTML bundle.
src/*/_sphinx_html/.doctrees/
